  "body": "### Summary\n\nCapture on the Mac, with the LOT-001 (#38) kit (`tooling/fixtures/`), a **group** private conversation (three members or more). No group conversation is captured today, so LOT-058 cannot port the group-members action (redface2 E8), and legacy has no source for it.\n\n### Scope\n\n- The reply form (`message.php`) of a group MP **seen by its owner**, with the `newdest` member list, as a read-only GET.\n- The same thread **seen by a member** who is not the owner: the read-only roster.\n- This needs a third account (checklist item N07). Creating the group is a write: it needs the operator's approval first (AGENTS.md §0). Use the operator's own accounts only.\n\nRules: anonymize every free-text field: pseudos → `user1`/`user2`/`userN`, ids → `9000NN`. Never hand-build the state in the cloud (LESSONS 36). One PR per batch of captures.\n\n### Wanted by\n\nLOT-058 (#84, MP actions), and through it LOT-127 (#218, app MP actions) and LOT-171 (#297, group MP lists).\n\n### Depends on\n\nThe operator's approval for the group creation (write).\n\n### Owner / session\n\n— (ready; `host: mac`)\n\n### Source\n\nLOT-058 issue body (steward rewrite, 2026-10-29). Restart plan on #166.",
