   "body": "### Capture result\nPR #480 (`R123a`-`R123f`, `W70`, `R123k`, oracles in `Fixtures/M2-writes/`). One group MP was sent by an operator account to two recipients.\n- Recipients are comma-separated (`dest=a,b`), as the new-MP form says.\n- The owner's reply form has `newdest` (the other members joined by \", \"). The non-owner member's reply form has no roster row and no `newdest`. Neither thread page shows a roster. A member sees the others only in the MP list row title (`Interlocuteurs multiples` span).\n- This contradicts the E8 note in `docs/research/redface2-comparison.md` (read-only text in the composer), so LOT-127 and LOT-171 must follow the capture.\n- Not captured: HFR's answer to an unknown pseudo as recipient.",
   "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
